flowchart LR
  U[Guest/User] --> A[Open Camera/Scanner]
  A --> B[Scan QR Code on Table/Room]
  B --> C["GET /qr/{code}"]
  C --> D["Server: Resolve QR -> Context (hotel, table, booking)"]
  D --> E["Return Menu / Order Context"]
  E --> F[User places order or views details]
  F --> G[Associate actions with booking/staff]
